#: ../../reference/config-schema.md:298
msgid ""
"Requiring two signals is what keeps real misspellings visible. `Hoare` is "
"suppressed because it is a known surname *and* capitalized mid-sentence; "
"`thier` is not, because it is lowercase and sits one edit from `their`. "
"Raising `aggressiveness` lowers that bar and will eventually cost you real "
"typos."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/config-schema.md:303
msgid ""
"Capitalization is ignored as a signal for German (`de-*`), where every noun "
"is capitalized and the shape carries no information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/config-schema.md:306
msgid ""
